## 2. Core Concept

Most try-on tools answer "how does this item look on me?"
LOOKSMITH answers "what should I wear and buy, **given my skin, tone and occasion**, and how does the complete look appear on me?"

Differentiators (build all):
1. **Skin-aware makeup.** Skin Analysis results choose makeup finish and intensity.
2. **Tone-aware palette.** Skin Tone Analysis (skin, eye, brow, lip, hair colours) builds a personal colour palette. Garments are matched to it.
3. **Visible agent loop.** Plan → try on → critique → swap → retry. Shown live in UI.
4. **Taste memory.** Likes/dislikes update preferences. Next looks improve.
5. **Retailer widget mode.** One script tag. Retailer catalog in. Shoppable looks out. Theme via tokens.
6. **Shareable Look Card.** Social loop.

