## 15. Things To Avoid
- Generic "filter app" look: neon gradients, glossy glassmorphism overload, emoji icons.
- Dead spinners. Walls of text. Tiny tap targets.
- Showing numbers without meaning.
- Over-claiming accuracy or medical benefit.
- Building features that do not appear in the demo path before the core is polished.
- Hard-coding fake outputs without labelling them as demo data.

Begin with the repo scaffold, `DECISIONS.md`, and `docs/YOUCAM_NOTES.md` (from reading the real docs). Then execute slices in order.